      "private_thought": "No trade completes a set. Missing thirds are bank-owned (PA, Baltic, Oriental, Atlantic) or p1 mortgaged (Marvin, Vermont) plus a bank deed. Spending cash fails the BW 3h test: $1157 + $520 mortgages = $1677 vs $1400, only ~$277 spare. Do not sell Ventnor, CT, or the green pair. Do not fund p3 (pinks, $719, can't afford 3-houses) or p4 (PP2/BW3, $74, static until a rent). Reserve $320 for PA Ave, then build greens evenly. p1 oranges are survivable. End turn.",
      "public_message": "Cash stays put. Your turn.",
